#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Fuzz test for the _pickle module using the test.fuzzhelper library.

This script defines `dir_func` to randomly modify object attributes and
runs 9999 iterations of fuzz testing on _pickle functions with a variety
of input types (objects, bytes, file objects, booleans).
