You can dynamically generate an HTML list from a JavaScript array using the DOM API. Here’s a step-by-step approach, including how to display only specific fruits if needed.

## 1. Create a basic HTML structure
Place a container element (like a `<ul>` or `<div>`) where the list will be rendered. Give it an `id` so JavaScript can find it easily.

```html
